From 497ea7e1be06caf9e131ac6794831d0313676708 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shirjan Khadka <shirjan.2.khadka@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 10:35:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Concept 03 homepage rebuild: index strip, market wrap,
 newsroom with real data

---
 css/nd-home.css         | 101 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 js/nd-home.js           | 177 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 nepse-decode/index.html |  23 ++++++
 3 files changed, 301 insertions(+)
